@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Cloudflare Agents runtime
+
+The Worker owner must export each deployed agent class and declare its matching Durable Object namespace binding. Each new `AIChatAgent` class also requires a uniquely tagged SQLite Durable Object migration using `new_sqlite_classes`.
+
+The deployment environment must supply the AI provider binding or credentials selected by the Worker; a Workers AI deployment declares its `AI` binding explicitly. The Worker owner is responsible for maintaining these bindings and secrets, applying migrations, routing requests to the agents, and validating the target environment before deployment.
